OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in single-vehicle crash
OL,4,Aon roundabout
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died following a
OL,7,Fsingle-vehicle crash in the early hours
OL,8,Fof the morning.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Monkswood Way in
OL,11,FStevenage, Hertfordshire, at 03:10 BST
OL,12,Fafter a black Kia Sportage collided
OL,13,Fwith a barrier on a roundabout.
OL,15,FFirefighters and paramedics were also
OL,16,Fcalled and the driver of the car, a man
OL,17,Fin his 40s, died at the scene.
OL,19,FA police spokesperson said formal
OL,20,Fidentification was yet to take place,
OL,21,Fbut the man's next of kin had been
OL,22,Finformed.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
